  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "One is green and one is red. They are tied together like two jade bracelets and quietly let out warm luster as they hover.",
        "chapters": [
          226
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "They are green as grass and red as blood, tied together so they cannot be separated.",
        "chapters": [
          229
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Bai Ning Bing refines the red half after Fang Yuan removes his imprint and cooperates. When she finishes, the bracelets dissipate and become circular marks on the wrists (green on Fang Yuan’s left, red on Bai Ning Bing’s right), leaving a sense of linked flesh and blood between them.",
        "chapters": [
          230
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-effect-and-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It converts another Gu Master’s primeval essence into the receiver’s own aura during transfer, so the essence can be used to wash and refine the aperture without the usual mixed-aura problem of ordinary imparting.",
        "chapters": [
          226
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-effect-and-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The Gu is a series, not a single fixed worm. Quality depends on how deep the relation is between the refiners, from low to high: fratricidal, friendly relation, indissoluble relation, familial relation, and blood kin relation. Conversion efficiency rises with that quality: fratricidal keeps one-fifth of a ten-percent transfer, friendly two-fifth, indissoluble three-fifth, familial four-fifth, and blood kin the full amount.",
        "chapters": [
          230
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-effect-and-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing hold the mid-quality indissoluble relation form, a rank three Gu. That mid quality is the middle result of mixing the twins’ deep blood-kin relation with Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing’s fratricidal-level relation, after Fang Yuan tampers with the recipe at the last step.",
        "chapters": [
          230
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-effect-and-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "With it, Bai Ning Bing’s snow silver essence can drive Fang Yuan’s early breakthroughs far faster than liquor-worm methods alone, including help when breaking a large realm.",
        "chapters": [
          230
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-effect-and-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After both refine the pair, they cultivate by pressing palms and moving essence through the marks.",
        "chapters": [
          230
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-effect-and-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "One night of that method raises Fang Yuan from rank one upper stage to rank one peak stage. He values the Gu above Blood Skull Gu and Heavenly Essence Treasure Lotus in that stretch, below only Spring Autumn Cicada.",
        "chapters": [
          231
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-effect-and-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_demonic_blood_skull_gu",
          "gu_heavenly_essence_treasure_lotus",
          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
