  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan ranks Bone Flesh Unity Gu as the most important prize of the Bai Gu mountain white bone inheritance, a cultivation-category Gu that lets two Gu Masters advance together by dual cultivation.",
        "chapters": [
          214
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "loc_bai_gu_mountain",
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When both finish refining, the linked jade bracelets dissipate and become circular marks on the wrists, green on Fang Yuan’s left and red on Bai Ning Bing’s right.",
        "chapters": [
          230
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wrist-marks",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In Shang clan city the Gu sits as a bracelet tattoo on his arm.",
        "chapters": [
          273
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wrist-marks",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_shang_clan_city"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "On the caravan road they sit with Bai Ning Bing’s palms on Fang Yuan’s back. Ten percent of her snow silver essence flows out; Bone Flesh Unity Gu shines green and red and converts it so six percent enters Fang Yuan’s aperture.",
        "chapters": [
          245
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "paired-cultivation-years",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In Shang clan city the same method breaks him from rank two peak stage into rank three initial stage in about six hours, while the Gu sits as a bracelet tattoo on his arm outside the aperture Gu list.",
        "chapters": [
          273
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "paired-cultivation-years",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When Bai Ning Bing reaches rank four and Fang Yuan is still rank three peak stage, he judges that once their cultivation matches, Bone Flesh Unity Gu will help him much less, which is why he pushes for a rank four nine eyes liquor worm.",
        "chapters": [
          326
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "paired-cultivation-years",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Bai Ning Bing’s rank four light gold essence through the Gu is still decisive when he breaks into rank four: after his own snow silver essence empties at the border, her waterfall of light gold essence finishes the aperture-wall collapse. He credits Bone Flesh Unity Gu, Bai Ning Bing, and Shang clan city’s environment for that two-to-three-year climb.",
        "chapters": [
          331
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "paired-cultivation-years",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan still treats the rank three Gu as valuable because many Gu Masters can use it even at that rank, and groups it with Self-reliance Gu as a worm that need not match the owner’s rank to stay useful.",
        "chapters": [
          345
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "paired-cultivation-years",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_self_reliance_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After he reaches rank four initial stage and the poison vow is gone, he tells himself he already has no need for Bone Flesh Unity Gu and delays saving Bai Ning Bing so he can cultivate past her.",
        "chapters": [
          355
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "paired-cultivation-years",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Later at San Cha mountain the transfer runs the other way: with nine eyes liquor worm purifying his bright gold essence into essence gold, he pours that essence into Bai Ning Bing’s rank four initial stage aperture through the Gu and helps nourish her walls.",
        "chapters": [
          365
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "paired-cultivation-years",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_san_cha_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When he cannot use several worms in Northern Plains, he leaves Bone Flesh Unity Gu in Hu Immortal blessed land with Blood Skull Gu, yin-yang rotation Gu, and other Gu that are not useful at that moment.",
        "chapters": [
          504
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "blessed-land-storage",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "reg_northern_plains",
          "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
          "gu_yin_yang_rotation_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Rank three Bone Flesh Unity Gu still sits among what remains in Hu Immortal blessed land, not as something he and Bai Ning Bing still hold together in his aperture.",
        "chapters": [
          581
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "blessed-land-storage",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_rank_three"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "No cited later chapter describes the pair’s fate after that inventory line.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "blessed-land-storage",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
